SALLE ALA ZAINAB SABR TERA ZAINAB<br>
<br>
Aun-o-mohammed Ke Laashe Juhi Aaye<br>
Sajd-e-shukrana Tune Kiya Zainab<br>
<br>
Jano Dil-e-Zehra Tu Thi Rasan Basta<br>
Kaisa Sitam Haye Tujh Pa Huwa Zainab<br>
<br>
Zeenate Alam Ki Tujh Se Hi Zeenath Thi<br>
Zeenate Majlis Hai Naam Tera Zainab<br>
<br>
Nouke Sina Par Tha Sar Shahe Wala Ka<br>
Bhai Ka Yun Pursa Tuj Ko Mila Zainab<br>
<br>
Toot Gai Har Aas Ab Hai Kahan Abbas<br>
So Gaya Karbala Main Bhai Tera Zainab<br>
<br>
Sham Ka Wo Bazar Sham Ka Wo Darbar<br>
Lab Par Raha Tere Shukre Khuda Zainab<br>
<br>
Sham O Kufa Ho Ya Wo Madina Ho<br>
Dil Main Rahi Tere Karbobala Zainab<br>
<br>
Shan Thi Kya Teri Kufe Ki Shahzadi<br>
Tera Muhafiz Tha Baba Tera Zainab<br>
<br>
Waqt Ne Karwat Li Kaise Ghadi Aayi<br>
Chin Gai Balwe Main Teri Rida Zainab